Name: Ghoti.io Runtime-jit(BRANCH)
Description: The language runtime stack's baseline JIT: a low-level IR, an x86-64 backend, and the stack maps and deopt records it emits in runtime-core's format.
Version: (VERSION)
URL: https://github.com/Ghoti-io/runtime-jit
Libs: -L(PC_LIB_DIR) -l(SUITE)-(PROJECT)(BRANCH) -pthread
CFlags: -I(PC_INCLUDE_DIR)
Requires: (REQUIRES)
